{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>הפלה חסדיך</b> — separated and distinguished, as in 'who performs wonders' [i.e., the root פלא]." "<b>ובימינך</b> — joined to 'those who take refuge,' for we do not find this form without a bet. And some say: it is construct to the word 'savior.'"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:26.172676281Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}